<title>SOUTH AFRICA: FOREIGNERS NET SELLERS OF SAFRICA SHARES LAST WEEK.</title>
<headline>FOREIGNERS NET SELLERS OF SAFRICA SHARES LAST WEEK.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Johannesburg Stock</p>
<p>Exchange (JSE) said non-residents were net sellers of shares on</p>
<p>the exchange last week.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand) -</p>
<p>			Week to Nov 4    Year to date   Year ago	</p>
<p>Equities:</p>
<p>- purchases		   560.22   33,801.14	20,008.79</p>
<p>- sales		     1,316.16   29,474.37	15,912.54</p>
<p>- net purchases/(sales)  (755.94)   4,326.77	 4,096.25</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures reflect only the portion of the market</p>
<p>where non-resident transactions are executed through the JSE,</p>
<p>and are therefore not comprehensive.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482-1003</p>
</text>
